*begin Poppy
*data normal from to tape compass clino ignoreall
*units length metres
*calibrate tape 0.0
*units compass degrees
*calibrate compass 0.0
*units clino degrees
*calibrate clino 0.0

*title "Poppy Passage / Moribund Inlet / Trick or treat"
*team tape 
*team pics 
*team insts 
*team notes 

*include Poppy1
*include Poppy2
*include Poppy3

*equate poppy2.1 poppy3.1
*equate Poppy2.34 Poppy1.46



*end Poppy
